# prompt-revision: the `prompt` axis sets the system prompt under test, the only thing the two configurations
# change; the handbook is the same for both and read from the project itself. The question goes in as people typed it.
# model before provider: nb builds the provider's client as soon as it reads `provider`.
model {{model}}
provider {{provider}}
harness {{harness}}
tools none
system @{{param.PROMPT}}/system.md
system @../../bot/knowledge.md
run {{prompt}}
